@title Help popups: short labels with a ? popup in Calculations, Standards check, Sizing, Print preview, Kitting and Bench output
@area Windows
open_starter_example
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text calculations
key enter
wait 10
shot calculations
tree Help
key Escape
wait 5
key ctrl+k
text Standards check
key enter
wait 10
shot standards
tree Help
key Escape
wait 5
key ctrl+k
text size enclosure
key enter
wait 10
shot sizing
tree Help
key Escape
wait 5
key ctrl+k
text Kitting
key enter
wait 10
shot kitting
tree Help
key Escape
wait 5
key ctrl+k
text print preview
key enter
wait 10
shot print-preview
tree Help
check_layout
